---
kind: quest
luteVersion: "0.15.1"
uses: ../world.schema.yaml
title: What Vesna Carries
---

/*
  The only quest in the project whose `start=` is a scalar threshold. It opens at
  hydroponics — episode 4, the first scene that asks the player to say something
  true and prices the answer — because that is where Vesna stops being the person
  giving instructions and starts being a person deciding what you are worth.

  `sheCanStopIt` is `holds(can_halt(vesna))`, the head of the project's one rule:
  awake AND knows the sequence. Vesna is awake from the world seed, so this
  objective is exactly "she read the sequence aloud in the archive" — the derived
  relation doing the work a mirror flag would otherwise be doing by hand.
*/
<quest id="whatVesnaCarries" title="What Vesna Carries" start="run.vesnaTrust >= 2" after="visited('anseo.s01ep04')">
<objective id="sheWillWorkWithYours" title="Be somebody she can work with" done="run.vesnaTrust >= 3"/>
<objective id="sheCanStopIt" title="Have her know the halt condition well enough to use it" done="holds(can_halt(vesna))"/>
<objective id="sheHasThePaper" title="Have her holding the manifest when it matters" done="holds(knows(vesna, manifest))" optional/>
<on event="questComplete">
@narrator: She had the page, she had the condition, and she had somebody she could say both to out loud.
</on>
</quest>
